// Front 124 — bpp CLI · examples/scaffold/app/not-found.bpp
//
// Demonstrates: step 5 — the root not-found boundary of the scaffold. The
// file's name is its kind: for `not-found.bpp`, the unfold (front 116) gives
// the function its decorator through jhonstart's `bppKinds` (decision 221).
// onze's generated routes table imports `NotFound` from a not-found module
// (`onze-cli/src/generate.bp`); decision 213 names the function after the file,
// and `not-found` is not a function name — open (front 116 README § Notes).
// It takes no parameter, so the fence has no `route`.
//
// A fence may be empty of statements: the imports are declarations, and the
// body of `NotFound` is the template alone.
//
// Upstream: astro-docs/07-astro-pages.md (Página de Erro 404 Personalizada)
//           https://docs.astro.build/en/basics/astro-pages/#custom-404-error-page

import {a, h1, p} from "jhonstart";
